t ceramic shop, viewed from an elevated angle. The room features a polished marble floor with white and gray veining. In the center, there is a wooden counter with a small computer monitor on its right side and a colorful brochure display on its front. To the left of the counter, a modern ATM machine is installed. The back wall showcases an array of ceramic artifacts, including vases, plates, and bowls, arranged in wooden shelves that extend from floor to ceiling. The shelves are adorned with intricate wooden carvings and are filled with a variety of ceramics in different shapes, sizes, and colors, predominantly in blue and white, red, and gold.\n\nAbove the shelves, there are more ceramic items, including ornate vases and figurines, which are neatly displayed. To the right, a large wooden archway with a detailed lattice design leads to another room, where a cream-colored curtain is partially visible. The walls are decorated with traditional Asian calligraphy and paintings, adding to the cultural ambiance. The lighting is warm and inviting, highlighting the rich textures and colors of the ceramics and the polished wood. The overall style of the shop is traditional yet modern, blending cultural heritage with contemporary elements."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 382, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [444.7947692871094, 195.25372314453125], "pos": [-657.658447265625, 969.552978515625], "id": 60, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1,自动反推\n2，手动输入"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-310.92138671875, 842.6156616210938], "id": 69, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "orde